@page "/about"

<div class="page-header">
    <div class="page-title">
        <i class="bi bi-info-circle-fill"></i>
        <h1>About this project</h1>
    </div>

    <div class="page-subtitle">
        Information about SocialCareManager and the developer behind it.
    </div>
</div>

<div class="section-card mb-4">
    <div class="section-card-header">
        <i class="bi bi-app-indicator"></i>
        <h3>What is SocialCareManager?</h3>
    </div>

    <p>
        SocialCareManager is a portfolio project built to demonstrate full-stack
        development skills for social healtCare management systems.
        It includes service user records, care plans, daily notes, medication
        tracking, and role-based access for Admin and Staff users.
    </p>

    <p class="mb-0">
        <strong>Note:</strong> This is a demo application for showcasing purposes only.
        It is not intended for real-world use with real personal or care data.
    </p>
</div>

<div class="section-card mb-4">
    <div class="section-card-header">
        <i class="bi bi-code-slash"></i>
        <h3>Technology stack</h3>
    </div>

    <ul class="mb-0">
        <li>ASP.NET Core 10 Web API</li>
        <li>Blazor Web Interactive Server</li>
        <li>C#</li>
        <li>Entity Framework Core</li>
        <li>PostgreSQL</li>
        <li>ASP.NET Core Identity (token-based authentication)</li>
        <li>Role-based authorization (Admin / Staff)</li>
        <li>DTO + Mapper + Validator architecture</li>
        <li>Soft delete & audit trail on all entities</li>
    </ul>
</div>

